SurData-io/lmcache (LMCache fork)
================================

This public repository is a SurData-maintained fork of LMCache.
It ships the LMCache engine (`lmcache/`) and the vLLM adapter under
Apache License 2.0.

Upstream: https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache (Apache-2.0)
Baseline tag: v0.5.3
Baseline commit: 140819c9d57a975dbc5678a6459a218e544cb58b

SurData additions in this tree include GDS page-direct KV I/O in the
engine and vLLM connector path. The SurData storage SDK, kernel module,
and meta services are **not** included.

See NOTICE.surdata for the SurData copyright notice, and
third-party/lmcache/NOTICE for vendored connector-header provenance.
